abstract: >-
  Metabolomics-domain DomainAdapters for the indicium ecosystem.
  Bundles MetabolomicsAdapter (base), MetaboKGAdapter, EMIAdapter
  (ENPKG + METRIN-KG), plus a mzTab-M 2.0 parser and a ~156k-compound
  cross-reference table.
